{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2039. In a dystopian Arizona, you set out to find your missing uncle and recover government-confiscated technologies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with engineering skills and determination, you\u2019ll explore an open world to gather energy and resources, unlock new machine parts and establish a network of bases. You'll assemble a fleet of rovers, drones and robots and use those to infiltrate government facilities, uncover dark secrets, and reveal the truth about your uncle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Machines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engineer a fleet of machines. Use mechanical parts, engines, weapons, and electronics to build machines that drive, fly, fight, mine resources, hack and more.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532270/extras/4a390269d27388d8ff17a666bc2446a4.poster.avif?t=1770059786\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532270/extras/4a390269d27388d8ff17a666bc2446a4.webm?t=1770059786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532270/extras/4a390269d27388d8ff17a666bc2446a4.mp4?t=1770059786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Construct Bases</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and expand your network of bases. Build fueling stations, research facilities, resource storage silos and defense outposts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532270/extras/8d13ae3c28441aed74e64df7e3f87971.poster.avif?t=1770059786\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532270/extras/8d13ae3c28441aed74e64df7e3f87971.webm?t=1770059786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532270/extras/8d13ae3c28441aed74e64df7e3f87971.mp4?t=1770059786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Source Energy, Resources and Parts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an open world to discover new parts, source energy, and mine resources to upgrade and expand your fleet of machines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532270/extras/bc875b7f3505787be6855ea9de027136.poster.avif?t=1770059786\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532270/extras/bc875b7f3505787be6855ea9de027136.webm?t=1770059786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532270/extras/bc875b7f3505787be6855ea9de027136.mp4?t=1770059786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight or Outsmart</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infiltrate enemy bases guarded by robots and drones. Fight your way through or use advanced electronics to stay unseen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532270/extras/f591ccdc76cb64e3e7bec4271dc3707b.poster.avif?t=1770059786\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532270/extras/f591ccdc76cb64e3e7bec4271dc3707b.webm?t=1770059786\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532270/extras/f591ccdc76cb64e3e7bec4271dc3707b.mp4?t=1770059786\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1532270?t=1770059786","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1532270?t=1770059786","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532270/b485991e9c1999bd94a5a32f2331327a6c4851a1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770059786","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532270/b485991e9c1999bd94a5a32f2331327a6c4851a1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770059786","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2421490,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2039. In a dystopian Arizona, you set out to find your missing uncle and recover government-confiscated technologies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Armed with engineering skills and determination, you\u2019ll explore an open world to gather energy and resources, unlock new machine parts and establish a network of bases. You'll assemble a fleet of rovers, drones and robots and use those to infiltrate government facilities, uncover dark secrets, and reveal the truth about your uncle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Machines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engineer a fleet of machines. Use mechanical parts, engines, weapons, and electronics to build machines that drive, fly, fight, mine resources, hack and more.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1532270/extras/4a390269d27388d8ff17a666bc2446a4.poster.avif?t=1770059786\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/15322